" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">No conceptual agreement,</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">no proposal.</text>\n                </svg>",
