     "explanation": "Sponsor disengagement at week 6 almost always traces to lack of a visible 30-day win. Sponsors stay engaged when they see returns; they drift when they don't. Producing a longer document compounds the problem — sponsors don't disengage because they need MORE information, they disengage because nothing in operations has changed. Working consultants who fix this don't ask the sponsor for more time — they produce a visible change, then the sponsor returns voluntarily.",
