" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Separate engagement + scoping call</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Four sentences, polite refusal to absorb</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SCENARIO 4 — REPEAT PATTERN</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Name pattern + formal scope review</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Five sentences, warm not annoyed</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Four templates protect a career of fees"
