     "explanation": "Sponsor enthusiasm peaks at major milestones. The 30-day visible win and close-out are the moments when the client's gratitude, recall, and willingness to advocate are highest. Waiting six months lets memory fade and attention shift; the engagement becomes 'just how things work now.' Waiting for proactive praise puts your business on the client's calendar, not yours — most clients never get there. Ask specifically, ask warmly, ask EARLY — the math favors action.",
