" y=\"655\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">STEP 4 — SUBMIT</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Fill forms, attach proposal, hit submit</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"750\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">STEP 5 — TRACK + RE-APPLY</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Weekly 1-2 applications → 10-30 events/year</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"890\" width=\"700\" height=\"60\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">From \"I should speak more\" to applications submitted</text>\n                </svg>",
