      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">$90K BUILD → $1.4M PRACTICE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Boardroom Conflict Index, 24 months</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">BUILD COST</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">$50K cash + 40 hours her time = ~$90K all-in</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"330\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PRICING TIERS</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">$1.5K / $3.5K / $15K / $35K-$60K</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"470\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">YEAR 1 REVENUE</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"565\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Individual ($270K) + Team ($180K) + Function ($90K)</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">= $540K — 6x the build cost in 12 months</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"650\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">YEAR 2 REVENUE</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">$330K + $225K + $280K = $835K</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Plus 30% lift to her project consulting</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"830\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"885\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">$620K → $1.4M practice</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Same hours. Different leverage.</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Productization breaks the time ceiling"
