     "explanation": "IP licensing has the highest leverage because the marginal time cost is near zero. A consultant with 8 active licenses at $50K + $10K/year can earn $400K-$800K annually with perhaps 50 hours of total maintenance time — an implied rate of $8K-$16K per hour. Project consulting (even premium) is hour-bound; speaking is high-fee but still time-bound; hourly coaching is hour-bound by definition. The leverage shift is FROM time-bound revenue TO non-time-bound revenue, and IP licensing is the most extreme form.",
