     "explanation": "This is Weiss's textbook 'premature retreat' pattern. At day 45 with only 2 buyer conversations, the diagnosis is unambiguous: insufficient revenue-generating activity. The cure is not more infrastructure (website, branding, networking) — those feel productive but don't produce clients. The cure is doing what produces clients: 25 personal outbound notes, 5 referral check-ins, weekly articles, discovery calls. Lowering target fees locks in wrong positioning. Hiring a sales coach is procrastination dressed up as investment. Pause, redirect, execute the 5 weekly actions.",
